    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-repro-package> .

